# Native oneai_native.dll is staged by scripts/build_windows.ps1 (run on Windows)
# into platforms/windows/native/. Anchored with a leading slash so it does NOT
# match the C# source dir OneAI/Native/ (git matches case-insensitively here —
# an unanchored "native/" silently ignored the interop .cs files).
# Dotnet build output. A fresh checkout runs build_windows.ps1 to populate.
/native/
OneAI/bin/
OneAI/obj/
